1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:08,550
UMass Boston 8, Plymouth State 5. Two clocks tell this story.

2
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,249
Puck drops. Start the clock.

3
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:22,690
Three Beacons already on the crease.

4
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:26,789
Jude Kurtas. Ten seconds in.

5
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:33,021
Same pair, roles swapped. Krivtsov takes it to the net.

6
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:38,705
Merryman. Then Repmann. 4–1 after the first.

7
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:47,030
Then it turned. Plymouth State scores twice in 15 seconds. 4–4.

8
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:56,524
Two minutes later, three on two. Krivtsov again.

9
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:04,275
Teply, from Merryman. 6–4.

10
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:16,143
One more power play. Thirteen seconds left in the second.

11
00:01:20,900 --> 00:01:25,680
Five on four. Drummond low, Kurtas up top.

12
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:31,220
Kurtas, up top, finds Mortson at the far circle.

13
00:01:31,300 --> 00:01:36,932
One-timer, on one knee. And Krivtsov is right in the goalie's eyes.

14
00:01:37,300 --> 00:01:39,730
7.7 to spare.

15
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:48,610
From above: Mortson 34 feet out. Krivtsov screening in the slot.

16
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:58,071
10 seconds in. 7.7 left. 8 goals on 38 shots.

17
00:02:03,300 --> 00:02:08,328
And, the team says, the head coach's 500th game.
